2. Modified Train-Ticket service: ts-avatar-service

   Paths:   fork_ts-avatar-service/
            review_package_anon/injected_code/sut1_ts-avatar-service/

   NOTICE OF CHANGES, as required by Apache License 2.0 section 4(b):

   These files are derived from ts-avatar-service in the Train-Ticket
   repository named in item 1, and HAVE BEEN MODIFIED by the SecLogTrace
   authors. The modification adds a server-side request forgery sink: a
   request handler that fetches a caller-supplied URL without validating
   its destination. The sink exists to generate labelled SSRF telemetry and
   is not present in upstream Train-Ticket.

   The modification is deliberately vulnerable. Do not deploy it on a
   network you do not control.

   Original portions remain under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and the
   original copyright and attribution notices are retained in the files.

