4. Observability and analysis dependencies

   Jaeger, the OpenTelemetry Java instrumentation agent and the Kieker
   monitoring agent were used during collection. They are not redistributed
   here. Each carries its own licence at its own source. The Kieker agent is
   present in the SUT2 deployment because the upstream TeaStore images
   include it; its presence is visible in the process.command_args tag of
   the archived trace exports.

   Python analysis dependencies are listed in requirements.txt, with the
   exact resolved set used for verification in requirements-clean-env.txt.
   Each carries its own licence at its own distribution point.
